  "_declinedReadme": "DATA-01: transaction-state cues, identical to app/lib/engine/parser/transaction_state_cues.dart (drift test: app/test/engine/parser/transaction_state_cues_drift_test.dart) and applied by the same rule in parse.ts isDeclinedText: whole-token match after folding tashkeel/tatweel/hamza/ta marbuta/alef maqsura; a cue right after a stateCueMerchantIntroducers word (except after 'due'/'owing'), optionally followed by one stateCueMerchantNameWords word, is part of a name; a cue next to a stateCueGenericNouns plural (English after it, Arabic before it) or in a question is not a status; a cue preceded in its clause (sentence, or after a comma/colon) by a stateCueHypotheticalMarkers entry is not a status; a declinedExemptKeywords credit counts only when not negated, promised, or followed later in its sentence by a declined status that is not attributive (next to a stateCueTransactionNouns/stateCueGenericNouns word), and when it comes before the first declined status. A not-completed message is treated like ignoreKeywords (rejected, no AI).",
